{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21496","headline":"酬哥舒大少府寄同年科第 · 元稹","name":"酬哥舒大少府寄同年科第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年科第偏年少，未解知羞最爱狂。\n九陌争驰好鞍马，八人同着彩衣裳。\n自言行乐朝朝是，岂料浮生渐渐忙。\n赖得官闲且疎散，到君花下忆诸郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}